            "for 10 minutes over 2 weeks.",
            "for 10-15 minutes, 2-3 times a day.",
            "for 10 minutes over 8-10 days.",
            "For 10-15 minutes over 5-6 days.",
            "For 10-15 minutes over 10-12 days.",
            "for 10 minutes over 2 weeks",
